\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238690/extras/343750cde27e56eccdc5647f3992373a.poster.avif?t=1773265028\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238690/extras/343750cde27e56eccdc5647f3992373a.webm?t=1773265028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238690/extras/343750cde27e56eccdc5647f3992373a.mp4?t=1773265028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid procedurally generated dungeons for armor and powerful weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advance your faction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238690/extras/2e55bddeba5ca22f0401f092b204e486.poster.avif?t=1773265028\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238690/extras/2e55bddeba5ca22f0401f092b204e486.webm?t=1773265028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238690/extras/2e55bddeba5ca22f0401f092b204e486.mp4?t=1773265028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Research new technologies and unlock new abilities to stay ahead of other factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engage in diplomacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238690/extras/1e16fa0e45f4f13a1bfd2fc95840a955.poster.avif?t=1773265028\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238690/extras/1e16fa0e45f4f13a1bfd2fc95840a95